  Reproducible finite mathematical and software references, including Lorentzian
  causal-order checks, stored Wolfram counterchecks, and guarded declarative RAX
  execution and exact graph references for spectral indistinguishability. No physical validation, industrial superiority or independent
  person-level replication is implied. Apache-2.0 covers original project
  contributions; separately identified data and dependencies retain their own
  licenses as documented in LICENSE_SCOPE.md. AI-assisted implementation and
  internal checking are distinguished from external scientific review.
